#SUBSTITUTION

FIND
    显示|查找|查询|查寻|寻找

WHEN
    {是|在}((哪|那){一|几}天|礼拜几|星期几)|几(点几分|点{钟}|月几号|号|月)|(何|啥|那|哪)时|(什么|(哪|那))时候

RECENT
    最(近|后|新){的}{一个}
    上{一}次

IF
    有{没有}

#DICT

;use low confidence so that the soft conflict target (noun and verb) won't be dropped
to [conf=low] [exists;node=phoneCallVerb][notExists;node="localSearchCategory";constraint=adjAfter]
    (给|到){我{们}{的}} [conf=high]
    {一}下{我{们}{的}} [conf=def][exists;node=phoneCallVerb;category="call,call back,redial,facetime";constraint=adjBefore]

    ;e.g. 致电李小龙
    拨{打|到|通|给}{我{们}{的}}
    接{通|到}{我{们}{的}}
    呼叫{给|到}{我{们}{的}}
    拨号{给|到}
    {致|回}电
    call{给|到}{我{们}{的}} [exists;constraint=start]
    call{给|到}{我{们}{的}} [exists;node=phoneCallVerbPrefix;constraint=adjBefore]
    打{给|到|通}{我{们}{的}} [exists;constraint=start]
    打{给|到|通}{我{们}{的}} [exists;node=phoneCallVerbPrefix;constraint=adjBefore]

    重拨
    再(拨{打}|打|接{通}|呼{叫})一次
    (打|拨)回去
    打回给
    回电话
    回{复}

    电话 [notExists="过去,回去";constraint=adjAfter]
    号码

    face{ }time{音频|语音}{给|到}{我{们}{的}} [conf=high]
    (可视|视频)(电话|通话){给|到}{我{们}{的}} [conf=high]
    (座机)(电话|通话){给|到}{我{们}{的}}
    ;<rdar://problem/11287893> [Phone] CH:Sundance10A281: Siri will recognize the utterance '我想和<contact name> 说话／讲电话' which means 'want to talk with <contact name>' incorrectly.
    和|跟|找|与 [exists="讲电话,说话,FaceTime,通话,煲电话粥,视频电话,视频聊天";constraint=after]

    ;<rdar://problem/11307601> [Phone]? CH:Sundance10A291: Siri gives an incorrect respond for utterance '帮我电话联系一下XXX' .
    联系|一下|联系一下 [conf=high][exists;node="phoneCallVerb";constraint=adjBefore]
    给我 [exists;node=contactType]

    ;<rdar://problem/12802928> [CH][SMS] phone number failed to catch in variation '给号码<number>发信息/短信'
    ;which also applies to phone call domain
    给号码 [exists;node=phoneCallVerb;category="call,call back,redial,facetime"]
    去    [exists;node="phoneCallVerb,contactType"]
    ;打电话去我的办公室

    ;<rdar://problem/13459847> [zh_CN][Phone][NL] Unsupport complete utterances '我要找<contact>' in second step when siri ask '你要找谁'.
    找{{一}下} [exists;node=phoneCall;constraint=domainHint]


from
    来自{我{们}{的}} [exists;node=phoneCallNoun;constraint=after]

originated
    打{过}来的
    ;xx的来电
    的[exists;node=phoneCallNoun;constraint=after][exists="来电";constraint=after]
    ;xx昨天打来的电话
    的[exists;node=phoneCallNoun;constraint=after][exists;node=phoneCallDate]

    ;显示xx昨天打来的电话
    ${FIND} [notExists;node=phoneCallReference;constraint=adjAfter][notExists;node=phoneCallAttributes;constraint=adjAfter][notExists="all";constraint=adjAfter][exists;node=phoneCallNoun]
    ;我妈妈什么时候打给我的
    ;我妈妈有打给我吗
    ${WHEN}|${IF}[exists;node=phoneCallNoun;category=call;constraint=adjAfter]
    ;我妈妈上次来电什么时候
    ${RECENT}[exists;node=phoneCallNoun;category=call;constraint=after][infers;node=phoneCallAttributes;category=recent]

    ;xxx给我的语音留言
    的[exists;node=voiceMailNoun;category=voicemail;constraint=adjAfter]
    (给我|留|给我留)的[exists;node=voiceMailNoun;category=voicemail;constraint=adjAfter][conf=lg]

replace [conf=little][exists;node=phoneCall;constraint=domainHint]
    修改|更改|改到

remove [notExists="说,就说";constraint="adjBefore"][exists;node=phoneCall;constraint=domainHint]
    去掉|删除